Steelmatter R0 is a simulation for evaluation. It uses synthetic data,
synthetic signing keys and a simulated purchase-order destination. It is not
connected to any production system and must not be used to authorise real
purchases.

This product depends on third-party open-source components, fetched by the Go
and npm package managers and not included in this source distribution. They
are listed with their licences in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
